         <div type="commentary">
            <p>The inscription is engraved above the entrance of the rock shelter at Tham In Sua, directly onto the rock. It is located near a notch, next to <ref target="DHARMA_INSCIK01641-2.xml">K. 1641-2</ref>. <ref target="DHARMA_INSCIK01641-1.xml">K. 1641-1</ref> is located slightly to the west, and <ref target="DHARMA_INSCIK01641-4.xml">K. 1641-4</ref> lies to the east).</p>
             <p>Although the inscription is weathered, it is still possible to discern the preparatory dotted guide marks made by the lapicide's tool.</p>
         </div>
